OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 22 MAY
OL,4,G0930FVernon Kay
OL,5,     GSinger-songwriter Myles Smith
OL,6,     Gjoins Vernon to pick his final
OL,7,     Gtwo Tracks of My Years. Plus two
OL,8,     Glisteners take on the mid-morning
OL,9,     Gmusic quiz Ten To The Top.
OL,10,G1200FJeremy Vine
OL,11,     GJeremy and guests discuss the
OL,12,     Gnews headlines and talk to the
OL,13,     Gpeople making them.
OL,14,G1400FTrevor Nelson
OL,15,     GTrevor is bringing you some of
OL,16,     Gthe best music from across the
OL,17,     Gdecades to get you through the
OL,18,     Gafternoon.
OL,19,G1600FSara Cox
OL,20,     GIt's All Request Friday and Sara
OL,21,     Gwants to hear from you on 88291
OL,22,     Gor sara.cox@bbc.co.uk.
