OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 22 MAY
OL,4,G2300FThe Rock Show with Shaun Keaveny
OL,5,     GShaun celebrates Bob's upcoming
OL,6,     G85th birthday with some of the
OL,7,     Gbest Dylan rock covers, plus
OL,8,     Ganother chance to hear why he's
OL,9,     GMark Knopfler's Rock God.
OL,10,G0000FRomesh Ranganathan: For the Love
OL,11,     Fof Hip Hop
OL,12,     GRom is joined by M Huncho, a
OL,13,     Grapper from north west London. He
OL,14,     Gpicks three tracks that have
OL,15,     Ginfluenced him, and shares his
OL,16,     Gnew single, Wizard Of Oz.
